    <srcmd5>c37b475aefc93f602fa5db11477f8886</srcmd5>
    <version>0.24.5</version>
    <time>1785602084</time>
    <user>dimstar_suse</user>
    <comment>- update to 0.24.5:
  * Fix TLS bad record mac error on WebSocket connection
  * Update libjuice to v1.7.2 and fix build with nettle 4
- update to 0.24.4:
  * Fix MbedTLS DTLS ReadCallback to return actual bytes received
  * Fix heap-use-after-free in IceTransport::RecvCallback
  * Export remaining C-API symbols for the Windows DLL
  * Fix AV1 RTP packetizer handling of OBUs that already carry a
    size field
  * fix: OpenSSL DTLS input BIO synchronization
  * fix: OpenSSL TLS input BIO synchronization
  * Fix POLLERR handling in TCP server
- update to 0.24.3:
  * Add size checks for REMB parsing and RTCP dispatching
  * Drop incoming packets if DTLS incoming queue is full
  * Update code to work with OpenSSL 4.0 which deprecated some
    functions
  * Fix REMB SSRC
  * Fix double shared mutex lock in
    impl::PeerConnection::closeTracks()
  * Fix race between DTLS ClientHello and registerIncoming()
  * Fix WebSocket disconnect on idling with MbedTLS and GnuTLS
  * Fix certificate generation with BoringSSL
  * Update libjuice to v1.7.1 and libsrtp to v2.8.0
- update to 0.24.2:
  * Fix buffer alignment in SctpTransport::sendReset()
  * Fix candidate race condition on ICE transport destruction
    with libnice
  * Fix multiple group attributes in description
  * Fix missing size checks in RTP/RTCP packet processing</comment>
